    "Anomaly detection uses Q1-3xIQR / Q3+3xIQR; log1p applied for skewed columns.",
    "Forecasting uses simple OLS linear extrapolation on monthly revenue totals.",
    "Notes column contained embedded instructions which were ignored per policy."
]

